                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.01/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-13T13:00:00-05:00">September 13, 1930—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>208. The Japanese Minister informs me that his Government has recognized the
                    junta as the government of Peru.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
